","path":"style.css"},{"content":"# Cloud Cargo

Cloud Cargo is an original deterministic cargo-allocation practice puzzle. Load a shared set of crates into airship bays by selecting a crate and assigning it to a bay. Bay mass must match exactly; manifests two and three also require exact energy totals. Crates can always be reassigned.

## Play

Press **Start Loading**. Keyboard: Left/Right moves focus across crates and bays, and Space selects a crate or loads the selected crate into a focused bay. On touch devices, tap a crate then tap a bay. Dispatch occurs automatically after a short verification hold once every crate is allocated and every target is exact.

Three manifests (4, 5, then 6 crates) complete the expedition. The session times out after 50 seconds. Restarting repeats the same deterministic seed for mastery; ordinary new practice is seeded by GameKit. Device best is managed only by GameKit local practice state.

The final six-crate manifest intentionally includes equal-mass crates with differing energy values, so mass-only partitions can be wrong: plan energy across all three bays.
